radingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"KIM：創紀錄的入住率和強勁的租賃支撐成長，$2.5B+ 流動性支持投資"},{"title":"KIM: Record occupancy and stronger leasing drove higher FFO and NOI guidance","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"KIM：創紀錄的入住率和強勁的租賃推動了 FFO 和 NOI 指引的提高"},{"title":"KIM: Higher Q3 earnings, stronger same-property NOI and active capital deployment plans","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"KIM：第三季獲利更高，同業 NOI 更強，資本部署計畫積極"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/879101/000119312526060760/kim-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Company is the leading owner and operator of high-quality, open-air, grocery-anchored shopping centers and mixed-use properties in the United States. The executive officers are engaged in the day-to-day management and operation of real estate exclusively with the Company, with nearly all operating functions, including leasing, asset management, maintenance, construction, legal, finance and accounting, administered by the Company. The Company's mission is to create destinations for everyday living that inspire a sense of community and deliver value to our many stakeholders.","zh":"該公司是美國領先的高品質露天雜貨購物中心和綜合用途物業的所有者和營運商。執行官專門在公司從事房地產的日常管理和運營，幾乎所有營運職能，包括租賃、資產管理、維護、建築、法律、財務和會計，均由公司管理。公司的使命是創造日常生活目的地，激發社區意識並為我們的眾多利益相關者創造價值。"},{"en":"The Company began operations through its predecessor, The Kimco Corporation, which was organized in 1966 upon the contribution of several shopping center properties owned by its principal stockholders. In 1973, these principals formed the Company as a Delaware corporation, and, in 1985, the operations of The Kimco Corporation were merged into the Company. The Company completed its initial public stock offering (the \"IPO\") in November 1991, and, commencing with its taxable year which began January 1, 1992, elected to qualify as a REIT in accordance with Sections 856 through 860 of the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended (the \"Code\"). To qualify as a REIT, the Company must meet several organizational and operational requirements and is required to distribute annually at least 90% of its REIT taxable income, determined without regard to the dividends paid deduction and excluding any n","zh":"該公司透過其前身 Kimco Corporation 開始運營，該公司成立於 1966 年，由其主要股東擁有的幾個購物中心物業出資組建。 1973 年，這些負責人將公司組成特拉華州公司，並於 1985 年將 The Kimco Corporation 的業務併入公司。該公司於 1991 年 11 月完成首次公開募股（「IPO」），並從 1992 年 1 月 1 日開始的納稅年度開始，根據經修訂的 1986 年國內稅收法（「法典」）第 856 至 860 條選擇符合 REIT 資格。要獲得 REIT 資格，公司必須滿足多項組織和營運要求，並且需要每年分配至少 90% 的 REIT 應稅收入，確定時不考慮股息支付扣除，也不包括任何 n"},{"en":"The Company is a self-administered REIT and has owned and operated open-air shopping centers for over 65 years. The Company has not engaged, nor does it expect to retain, any REIT advisors in connection with the operation of its properties. The Company's ownership interests in real estate consist of its consolidated portfolio and portfolios where the Company owns an economic interest, such as properties in the Company's investment real estate management programs, where the Company partners with institutional investors and also retains management.","zh":"該公司是一家自行管理的房地產投資信託基金，擁有並經營露天購物中心超過 65 年。該公司尚未聘請、也不打算保留任何與其物業營運相關的房地產投資信託顧問。該公司在房地產中的所有權權益包括其合併投資組合和公司擁有經濟利益的投資組合，例如公司投資房地產管理計劃中的房產，公司與機構投資者合作並保留管理權。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["REG","VMRK","BXP","VNO","FRT"]}}